WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.560
… English, in the sense
that we sat down together

2
00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:13.635
and translated Sanskrit puja into English

3
00:00:13.635 --> 00:00:33.760
and tried to make it more understandable
by you people.

4
00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:43.080
It’s the day of Mahalakshmi puja they say,

5
00:00:43.080 --> 00:00:51.050
not only of Lakshmi Puja.
There’s a difference between the two.

6
00:00:51.050 --> 00:01:06.210
Mahalakshmi is one of the powers
of the three powers, main powers,

7
00:01:06.210 --> 00:01:24.160
of Adi Shakti. As you know:
Mahalakshmi, Mahasaraswati, Mahakali.

8
00:01:24.160 --> 00:01:37.720
Now these powers have powers at a material
level also, at a subtler level also.

9
00:01:37.720 --> 00:01:55.360
So Mahalakshmi power is achieved
after Lakshmi power, as they say.

10
00:01:55.360 --> 00:02:00.940
So, the Lakshmi…
there are eight powers of Lakshmi.

11
00:02:00.940 --> 00:02:12.700
This Lakshmi was born,
who came out of the sea, the great sea,

12
00:02:12.700 --> 00:02:18.565
which was churned thousands
and thousands of years back.

13
00:02:18.565 --> 00:02:21.580
And She came out of the sea
because She is the daughter of the sea.

14
00:02:21.580 --> 00:02:28.582
That’s why She’s called as Neeraja.

15
00:02:28.582 --> 00:02:30.820
‘Neera’ means ‘water’
and ‘ja’ means ‘born out of’.

16
00:02:30.820 --> 00:02:36.280
This has happened thousands and thousand

17
00:02:36.280 --> 00:02:43.060
So what is that?
What is this Lakshmi symbolically,

18
00:02:43.060 --> 00:02:49.990
what is it expressing?
It is expressing the awareness.

19
00:02:49.990 --> 00:02:57.100
Lakshmi expresses awareness,
and She came out of the sea,

20
00:02:57.100 --> 00:03:04.360
you know that. The awareness
first started growing in the sea.

21
00:03:04.360 --> 00:03:12.820
The life started existing in the sea,
to begin with, and then it grew out.

22
00:03:12.820 --> 00:03:17.950
Without the life there is no awareness.
First the life,

23
00:03:17.950 --> 00:03:22.420
because everything is jada (inanimate
matter), everything is dead.

24
00:03:22.420 --> 00:03:27.610
And when it becomes
life it means it has awareness.

25
00:03:27.610 --> 00:03:32.530
So the awareness started
growing in the sea.

26
00:03:32.530 --> 00:03:36.610
This is the symbolic expression.

27
00:03:36.610 --> 00:03:42.370
In the gross level
you can understand this way.

28
00:03:42.370 --> 00:03:46.690
But actually in the subtle level,
it is the other way round.

29
00:03:46.690 --> 00:03:52.420
And because we see things from the gross
level, we say that, that is symbolic.

30
00:03:52.420 --> 00:03:55.927
But actually from the other side
if you say, “This is symbolic.”

31
00:03:55.927 --> 00:04:03.700
Do you understand this point?
So for me it is symbolic to see

32
00:04:03.700 --> 00:04:13.900
how the life came into being in the sea
and that it became aware.

33
00:04:13.900 --> 00:04:17.725
For me it is symbolic.
And for you it is symbolic

34
00:04:17.725 --> 00:04:22.210
the other way round.
I mean if I see something from this side,

35
00:04:22.210 --> 00:04:29.707
I see this way and while
you see from that side you see this way.

36
00:04:29.707 --> 00:04:34.330
To understand this,
if you want to paint something on a glass,

37
00:04:35.500 --> 00:04:41.320
how do you paint it on the glass?
Have you any idea?

38
00:04:41.320 --> 00:04:45.910
You start painting first the outermost
things that you have to paint.

39
00:04:45.910 --> 00:04:49.090
For example
if you are painting the Goddess,

40
00:04:49.090 --> 00:04:54.430
first you will paint Her ornaments,
then Her sari, then Her body.

41
00:04:54.430 --> 00:05:00.670
Like that it will be moving
deeper from this side,

42
00:05:00.670 --> 00:05:02.740
if you are painting it on the glass,

43
00:05:02.740 --> 00:05:05.200
because you have to see
it from the other side.

44
00:05:05.200 --> 00:05:12.400
But supposing
you have to paint it on a canvas,

45
00:05:12.400 --> 00:05:16.630
you’ll paint it the other way round.
You first paint the body,

46
00:05:16.630 --> 00:05:23.530
then the sari and then the ornaments.
So to one thing it is symbolic

47
00:05:23.530 --> 00:05:29.950
because they think
this goes from their angle.

48
00:05:29.950 --> 00:05:36.670
To the other person who is from the other
angle this is absolutely symbolic.

49
00:05:36.670 --> 00:05:43.980
And it’s surprising
that everything is so symbolic

50
00:05:43.980 --> 00:05:51.130
and so much just the same that,
whatever you may say,

51
00:05:51.130 --> 00:05:55.000
the subtle remains subtle
and the gross remains gross.

52
00:06:00.430 --> 00:06:04.150
The one who is at the subtle
level sees the gross

53
00:06:04.150 --> 00:06:10.820
as a symbolic expression of the subtle.

54
00:06:10.820 --> 00:06:15.650
Now She was born in the sea.
She was called as Niraja.

55
00:06:15.650 --> 00:06:24.890
She was born in the sea.
Now Nira, that means ‘water’. My name is,

56
00:06:24.890 --> 00:06:29.150
one of them is, Nira as you know.
Out of Nirmala one name is Nira,

57
00:06:29.150 --> 00:06:34.570
Nima and Nira,
like that I have got three names,

58
00:06:34.570 --> 00:06:36.910
four names I should say.
The big one is Nirmala.

59
00:06:36.910 --> 00:06:49.146
So this Nira part means what?
That She was born in the sea.

60
00:06:49.146 --> 00:06:57.910
The name of Mary is also the same.
Maryam or Mary,

61
00:06:57.910 --> 00:07:01.981
I don’t know how you say in English.
But Maryam this comes from ‘marine’.

62
00:07:01.981 --> 00:07:06.490
The word ‘marine’.
‘Marine’ itself comes from the word Mary.

63
00:07:06.490 --> 00:07:29.090
So this Mahalakshmi, Mary, is named
and She is because She was born in the sea

64
00:07:29.090 --> 00:07:32.180
and that’s how Her name was Mary.
Mariana they call Her,

65
00:07:32.180 --> 00:07:37.880
some people call Her Mariana,
sometime call Her Miriam.

66
00:07:37.880 --> 00:07:44.240
All these words are indicating
that She was born in the sea.

67
00:07:44.240 --> 00:07:51.370
So She is Mahalakshmi.
Now Mary is Mahalakshmi

68
00:07:51.370 --> 00:07:58.330
and Ganesha is the child.
Now see how symbolically it works,

69
00:07:58.330 --> 00:08:04.375
that only in Diwali the Lakshmi
and the Ganesha are worshipped,

70
00:08:04.375 --> 00:08:10.360
only these two personalities.
Can you understand that?

71
00:08:10.360 --> 00:08:19.330
The symbol of Mahalakshmi,
for me, is Mary.

72
00:08:19.330 --> 00:08:22.225
For you it is Mahalakshmi is the symbol.

73
00:08:22.225 --> 00:08:29.350
And the symbol of Ganesha
outside is Christ.

74
00:08:32.520 --> 00:08:38.820
He is symbolising Ganesha.
So, both of them are worshipped

75
00:08:38.820 --> 00:08:46.672
only on a Diwali day.
So actually this is the Christmas.

76
00:08:46.672 --> 00:08:49.050
This is the real Christmas
that was before also,

77
00:08:49.050 --> 00:08:56.460
and this was the time baby Christ
was born, not the 25th of December.

78
00:08:56.460 --> 00:08:59.673
Though it’s a misunderstanding,
doesn’t matter, keep it up.

79
00:08:59.673 --> 00:09:04.868
Doesn’t matter, whenever He’s born.

80
00:09:04.868 --> 00:09:09.450
Because there used
to be a very big festival,

81
00:09:09.450 --> 00:09:17.700
and after the festival He was born.
It’s called as Valanan.

82
00:09:17.700 --> 00:09:19.800
I don’t know
what you call in modern times.

83
00:09:19.800 --> 00:09:25.260
That time it was called like that.
And then this child was born

84
00:09:25.260 --> 00:09:29.040
and that was the time Christmas
was celebrated.

85
00:09:29.040 --> 00:09:33.090
It was just tallying with that,
but somehow it shifted.

86
00:09:33.090 --> 00:09:35.250
I don’t know how, how it shifted.

87
00:09:35.250 --> 00:09:38.628
And there might be somewhere you will find
out that the real Christmas was shifted.

88
00:09:38.628 --> 00:09:46.160
Yes it was. That’s known.

89
00:09:46.160 --> 00:09:46.670
All right.

90
00:09:46.670 --> 00:09:53.480
And symbolically in this lifetime also,
in the Kali Yuga also, same thing happens

91
00:09:53.480 --> 00:10:00.680
that Mahalakshmi and Ganesha were born,
and that’s why they are worshipped.

92
00:10:00.680 --> 00:10:04.250
Now you ask anyone, why Ganesha
and Mahalakshmi are worshipped,

93
00:10:04.250 --> 00:10:09.710
after all, on a Diwali day?
And it was the darkest night.

94
00:10:12.860 --> 00:10:19.550
It was the darkest night,
and that night a star was there.

95
00:10:19.550 --> 00:10:26.750
And because it was such a dark night
that star was very much noticed

96
00:10:26.750 --> 00:10:39.870
by everyone. It was a cold night,
very cold night, and a dark night.

97
00:10:39.870 --> 00:10:43.920
So the symbol of Diwali is very great
for Sahaj Yogis.

98
00:10:52.250 --> 00:10:59.630
First of all you have to know there are
four days that are celebrated in Diwali.

99
00:10:59.630 --> 00:11:06.838
But there is one more day added
to it in Maharashtra.

100
00:11:08.071 --> 00:11:17.116
The first day of Diwali is called
as Dhanatrayodashi:

101
00:11:17.116 --> 00:11:25.732
is the thirteenth day of the moon.
Because that day is the first day

102
00:11:25.789 --> 00:11:31.205
when Lakshmi, the first one,
was born on the thirteenth day.

103
00:11:31.205 --> 00:11:39.100
That means She was born as a Gruhalakshmi,
as a housewife.

104
00:11:39.100 --> 00:11:44.845
Now there are eight Lakshmis,
which she will read it out.

105
00:11:44.845 --> 00:11:47.213
And I will tell you later
on what is the meaning of them.

106
00:11:47.213 --> 00:11:55.860
One of them is Gruhalakshmi. So the first
is the form of a Gruhalakshmi.

107
00:11:55.860 --> 00:12:00.685
She is born
as a Gruhalakshmi to begin with.

108
00:12:00.685 --> 00:12:08.500
That means the awareness of human
beings also, started really

109
00:12:08.500 --> 00:12:17.650
getting into evolutionary process
when they started their family life.

110
00:12:17.650 --> 00:12:25.600
When they were vagabonds moving about,
then the awareness was just like animals.

111
00:12:25.600 --> 00:12:30.190
Though they had become human beings,
but they were like animals.

112
00:12:30.190 --> 00:12:39.160
Then when they established their families,
then the Gruhalakshmi started working

113
00:12:39.160 --> 00:12:44.620
and that’s how the first advent
of Gruhalakshmi was felt.

114
00:12:44.620 --> 00:12:49.450
So, She’s the first Lakshmi who was born,

115
00:12:49.450 --> 00:12:57.713
and that’s why on that thirteenth
day is the day of the Gruhalakshmi,

116
00:12:57.713 --> 00:13:02.530
of the housewife.
And so one has to go in the market

117
00:13:02.530 --> 00:13:08.047
and buy some utensils or something
that she uses for cooking in the house.

118
00:13:08.047 --> 00:13:18.040
In India on the thirteenth
day everyone goes and buys a pot or,

119
00:13:19.000 --> 00:13:25.978
we can say, what you call,
a cooking utensil or something.

120
00:13:25.978 --> 00:13:34.633
Or they may buy a sari or something
or gold or something for the Gruhalakshmi.

121
00:13:34.633 --> 00:13:42.108
That is the day of the household.

122
00:13:42.108 --> 00:13:49.160
So to reach the Lakshmi one has to understand
that motherhood is very important.

123
00:13:49.160 --> 00:13:55.570
The motherhood,
as a Gruhalakshmi is important.

124
00:13:55.570 --> 00:14:01.600
Then the second day is even more important

125
00:14:01.600 --> 00:14:12.300
because Narakasura was killed.
Horrible Narakasura, as you know him.

126
00:14:12.300 --> 00:14:16.860
But actually that day many rakshasas
are killed in many…

127
00:14:16.860 --> 00:14:27.256
That’s a day fixed for killing rakshasas.
And then they are put in the hell.

128
00:14:27.256 --> 00:14:31.184
On the fourteenth
day they are put in the hell.

129
00:14:31.184 --> 00:14:34.410
So that’s called as Naraka Chaturdashi.

130
00:14:34.410 --> 00:14:37.410
That is the day
when the hell is opened out.

131
00:14:37.410 --> 00:14:41.045
That day Sahaja Yogis are supposed
to sleep in the night while everybody

132
00:14:41.045 --> 00:14:47.539
does all kinds of tantrikavidya
and all that on the fourteenth day.

133
00:14:47.539 --> 00:14:55.200
Then the fifteenth is that darkest night.
That’s the darkest night

134
00:14:55.200 --> 00:15:00.600
when there is no moon.
Absolutely that’s the day

135
00:15:00.600 --> 00:15:08.820
when they celebrate Deepawali, Diwali day.
But symbolically, in India also,

136
00:15:08.820 --> 00:15:23.580
Shri Rama returned to his place
on that day and was crowned on that day.

137
00:15:23.840 --> 00:15:32.080
So the significance of Diwali
is expressed in this manner:

138
00:15:32.080 --> 00:15:36.960
that this is the day when Narakasura,
and all of them are killed,

139
00:15:36.960 --> 00:15:40.320
they have all gone to Narak,
they have gone to the hell,

140
00:15:40.320 --> 00:15:47.680
and the people now are saved from them
and they are celebrating the joy.

141
00:15:47.680 --> 00:15:51.760
And that is the time when Christ was born.

142
00:15:51.760 --> 00:15:54.480
That’s
why lights are to be put in the night,

143
00:15:54.480 --> 00:16:01.680
because He was born at twelve
o’clock in the night.

144
00:16:01.680 --> 00:16:06.560
So, the next day to that,
is the day [which] is celebrated in India

145
00:16:06.560 --> 00:16:09.957
only in Maharashtra. I don’t know
[if] people celebrate otherwise.

146
00:16:09.957 --> 00:16:10.878
I don’t know.

147
00:16:10.878 --> 00:16:13.196
Do you celebrate the next day?

148
00:16:13.196 --> 00:16:15.897
The next day?

149
00:16:15.897 --> 00:16:21.600
That’s the first day of the moon.
That is the forefathers of your Mother,

150
00:16:21.600 --> 00:16:26.640
Shalivahanas,
they started a calendar, from that date.

151
00:16:26.640 --> 00:16:36.920
And so on the first [day],
that means the first day of the moon,

152
00:16:39.680 --> 00:16:42.320
the new year is celebrated here.

153
00:16:42.320 --> 00:16:48.880
Now see symbolically, Christ is born
and a new year is celebrated the next day.

154
00:16:48.880 --> 00:16:52.320
As soon
as He is born the new year should start.

155
00:16:52.320 --> 00:17:05.280
So next year it starts, the new year.
That is a new year in many parts

156
00:17:05.280 --> 00:17:09.600
of our country
where Shalivahana ruled there.

157
00:17:09.600 --> 00:17:17.600
The Shalivahana was my forefather,
I should say, they were just a dynasty.

158
00:17:17.600 --> 00:17:21.920
And this dynasty ruled in India
since very long.

159
00:17:21.920 --> 00:17:33.280
Even in the old puranas it is written
that they helped Krishna in their war.

160
00:17:33.280 --> 00:17:40.720
You know all the story about Shalivahana,
quite a lot.

161
00:17:40.720 --> 00:17:47.040
And so the new year starts.
So for us that is the new year.

162
00:17:47.040 --> 00:17:51.440
For Sahaj Yogis that is the new year
and you have to accept it.

163
00:17:51.440 --> 00:17:53.840
And your Mother is of that dynasty.

164
00:17:53.840 --> 00:17:59.680
I mean no force
on you but if you like you can have it.

165
00:17:59.680 --> 00:18:03.120
Then the second
day is also very important:

166
00:18:03.120 --> 00:18:08.960
is the second day [of] the moon.

167
00:18:08.960 --> 00:18:15.520
That is [when] the moon
came out of the sea.

168
00:18:15.520 --> 00:18:20.080
According to this mythology,
the Lakshmi came out of the sea

169
00:18:20.080 --> 00:18:27.360
and with Her this moon came out,
which was only a two day old moon,

170
00:18:27.360 --> 00:18:32.560
the new moon but a two day old moon.
And this was regarded

171
00:18:32.560 --> 00:18:39.440
as the brother of Lakshmi,
because they were born at the same time,

172
00:18:39.440 --> 00:18:44.560
from the sea.
So He is the brother of Lakshmi.

173
00:18:44.560 --> 00:18:49.920
It’s all symbolic.
It’s very, very symbolic.

174
00:18:49.920 --> 00:19:19.520
Now the Left Side belongs to Mahakali,
and a brother had to be on this side,

175
00:19:19.520 --> 00:19:26.800
on the Left Side.
But actually you will be amazed

176
00:19:26.800 --> 00:19:35.920
that He is the brother of Lakshmi.
He is not a brother of Mahakali.

177
00:19:35.920 --> 00:19:41.360
But because He’s the brother
of Lakshmi he is accepted

178
00:19:41.360 --> 00:19:46.080
as a brother of all the goddesses:
one brother for all of them.

179
00:19:46.080 --> 00:19:51.440
So He is the only brother,
who is this moon.

180
00:19:51.440 --> 00:19:56.240
So He is your uncle,
He is your maternal uncle.

181
00:19:56.240 --> 00:19:59.360
It’s very interesting.
Because we have a special

182
00:19:59.360 --> 00:20:06.800
right on our maternal uncle,
we can always ask for His help.

183
00:20:06.800 --> 00:20:12.240
And it’s a big story about this churning

184
00:20:12.240 --> 00:20:18.800
that took place that Shiva
saw all the poison also coming out.

185
00:20:18.800 --> 00:20:21.440
So He drank the poison
because He was the only one who could

186
00:20:21.440 --> 00:20:27.360
drink the poison.
And He got so heated up in His head,

187
00:20:27.360 --> 00:20:32.400
in His neck
that He wanted something to cool Him.

188
00:20:32.400 --> 00:20:44.480
So He took to this moon
and put it on His head.

189
00:20:46.560 --> 00:20:49.120
So, the crowning [of Shiva] is the moon.

190
00:20:49.120 --> 00:21:00.000
Now if you see,
on Monday is the day of Sahasrara.

191
00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:06.622
Monday is the day of the Moon.
Monday is the day of Sahasrara

192
00:21:06.622 --> 00:21:10.320
because Sadashiva has put it on His head.
And that’s what people tease Him that,

193
00:21:10.320 --> 00:21:14.000
“Your brother-in-law
is sitting on your head.”

194
00:21:16.240 --> 00:21:21.920
(laughing) It’s very interesting.
It’s very symbolic for you — not for me,

195
00:21:21.920 --> 00:21:26.160
but for you — that the brother-in-law
is sitting on the head.

196
00:21:26.160 --> 00:21:32.240
This brother-in-law is very important,
and if brother-in-law is in any way angry

197
00:21:32.240 --> 00:21:38.400
then even Sadashiva has to think twice.
An all very special relationship,

198
00:21:38.400 --> 00:21:43.680
which is very sweet,
and which is very expressive.

199
00:21:46.800 --> 00:21:52.560
And if you want to understand it,
that your brother-in-law —

200
00:21:52.560 --> 00:21:55.840
is a naughty little thing —
is the brother of the wife.

201
00:21:55.840 --> 00:21:57.702
If you have to keep your wife pleased,

202
00:21:57.702 --> 00:22:02.640
that is the power, you have to keep
the brother-in-law quite happy.

203
00:22:02.640 --> 00:22:05.440
So He said it’s better
to keep him on His head.

204
00:22:06.560 --> 00:22:10.640
If there’s a naughty child,
what do you do to a naughty child?

205
00:22:10.640 --> 00:22:13.120
You put him up somewhere
there so he doesn’t move.

206
00:22:14.240 --> 00:22:19.600
Always you take a child outside,
you put him out there.

207
00:22:19.600 --> 00:22:27.920
And He is very dear to Sadashiva,
who really loves Him in a special way.

208
00:22:27.920 --> 00:22:39.280
And that day is the day
when all the sisters

209
00:22:39.280 --> 00:22:46.948
worship their brothers —
it’s very important it is.

210
00:22:46.948 --> 00:22:54.400
[On] Raksha Bandhan day they give
a symbolic expression to their desire

211
00:22:54.400 --> 00:23:02.080
that their brother should be good,
but on this day they worship

212
00:23:02.080 --> 00:23:05.280
their brothers,
they actually worship them.

213
00:23:05.280 --> 00:23:14.400
They are invited at home, they are made
to sit on the special type of a seat,

214
00:23:14.400 --> 00:23:20.800
then also aarti is done to them.
Sometimes if they are very small,

215
00:23:20.800 --> 00:23:25.920
younger brothers,
then they are even given bath nicely.

216
00:23:25.920 --> 00:23:29.680
If they are older brothers also they’ll
cover all their body, but water

217
00:23:29.680 --> 00:23:35.440
will be poured on them as a symbol
and they are given new dresses to wear.

218
00:23:35.440 --> 00:23:38.800
And very special food is cooked that day.

219
00:23:38.800 --> 00:23:43.040
And then they are served special
food ahead of their husbands.

220
00:23:43.040 --> 00:23:47.280
Always husband is served first, but
that day a brother gets the food first.

221
00:23:47.280 --> 00:23:49.840
And then the brother-in-law
is teased a lot,

222
00:23:49.840 --> 00:23:56.400
and the younger brother-in-law
teases his sister’s husband.

223
00:23:56.400 --> 00:24:01.920
And it’s a very nice function.
It’s called as Bhau-Beej.

224
00:24:01.920 --> 00:24:08.480
And that day the brother gives
some things to the sister as a present.

225
00:24:08.480 --> 00:24:13.200
He will give even if you don’t
have anything, you can give anything,

226
00:24:13.200 --> 00:24:23.680
whatever it is. But you give something
as a symbol of your love to your sister.

227
00:24:23.680 --> 00:24:31.200
And this day, today, is that day.
It’s such a nice day to do puja.

228
00:24:31.200 --> 00:24:36.080
This is the day
when we all adjust together.

229
00:24:36.080 --> 00:24:42.360
But for a Gruhalakshmi,
the brother is very important.

230
00:24:43.200 --> 00:24:50.560
And the brotherhood
and sisterhood is the base of our Sahaj

231
00:24:50.560 --> 00:24:54.800
Yoga collectivity.
If you understand that brotherhood

232
00:24:54.800 --> 00:25:08.000
and sisterhood is love which is very pure.
There is no expectation.

233
00:25:08.000 --> 00:25:14.320
It’s just love.
It’s giving love and taking love.

234
00:25:14.320 --> 00:25:21.440
And absolute purity within
us should exist between our relationships

235
00:25:21.440 --> 00:25:26.400
when we call them as Sahaj Yogi brothers
and sisters.

236
00:25:26.400 --> 00:25:31.280
And as there is understanding,
complete understanding,

237
00:25:31.280 --> 00:25:36.400
between the brother
and sister in a family,

238
00:25:36.400 --> 00:25:43.520
one has to know we are all part and parcel
of a family, born of the same Mother.

239
00:25:43.520 --> 00:25:48.240
Nobody has to shoot off
or nobody has to become something great,

240
00:25:48.240 --> 00:25:52.960
nobody has to correct others,
nobody has to say that,

241
00:25:52.960 --> 00:25:57.280
“I’m something unique.”
All of you have to work it out together

242
00:25:57.280 --> 00:26:01.200
and find out a solution working
out together in complete friendship

243
00:26:01.200 --> 00:26:07.040
and unison.
Anyone who cuts off himself and goes out

244
00:26:07.600 --> 00:26:10.400
or becomes anything else,
goes out of circulation

245
00:26:10.400 --> 00:26:15.920
and is useless for Sahaj Yoga.
Such a person is completely useless.

246
00:26:15.920 --> 00:26:22.480
The one who tries
to get out of the family.

247
00:26:22.480 --> 00:26:28.000
All of you have to be supporting
each other, helping to each other,

248
00:26:28.000 --> 00:26:31.440
not shouting at each other
or getting angry with each other;

249
00:26:31.440 --> 00:26:38.560
trusting each other, not finding faults;
treating each other with respect and love.

250
00:26:38.560 --> 00:26:41.920
This is the most important thing
the Sahaj Yogis don’t understand —

251
00:26:41.920 --> 00:26:45.440
that you are saints
and you have to respect each other.

252
00:26:45.440 --> 00:26:48.560
For example,
you cannot doubt each other, you cannot.

253
00:26:48.560 --> 00:26:58.960
That’s not allowed, it’s prohibited.
You are not to doubt each other.

254
00:26:58.960 --> 00:27:09.280
Here where, I would say that: if somebody
slaps you on one cheek, turn the other.

255
00:27:09.280 --> 00:27:15.760
That will work out here.
In this Sahaj Yoga one has to do it.

256
00:27:15.760 --> 00:27:19.360
Not to criticise anyone,
not to put down anyone.

257
00:27:19.360 --> 00:27:23.200
You are all Saints,
why don’t you recognise it?

258
00:27:23.200 --> 00:27:25.520
How can you insult a saint?

259
00:27:25.520 --> 00:27:33.760
You are men of God, do you realise that?
How can you put down anyone and say,

260
00:27:33.760 --> 00:27:37.440
“They are not good,” and, “They are good”?
If you start doing that,

261
00:27:37.440 --> 00:27:42.000
somebody else will take advantage
of you and will really push you down

262
00:27:42.000 --> 00:27:48.880
and you will be in very great trouble.
Never get into such funny ideas,

263
00:27:48.880 --> 00:27:54.320
that you are better than the others,
that you can do better than the others.

264
00:27:54.320 --> 00:27:57.920
The one who starts doing the better
is doing the greatest harm.

265
00:27:57.920 --> 00:28:03.600
There is no competition in Sahaj Yoga.

266
00:28:03.600 --> 00:28:07.440
Give up this idea of competition.
You are brothers and sisters.

267
00:28:07.440 --> 00:28:10.160
You have to support each other,
help each other.

268
00:28:10.160 --> 00:28:12.880
Anybody is going down,
try to work out on them.

269
00:28:12.880 --> 00:28:16.160
If you find somebody is going
down too much beat him with shoes.

270
00:28:16.160 --> 00:28:21.200
But anybody who thinks he is very great,
he has this special quality

271
00:28:21.200 --> 00:28:25.120
or that quality:
supposing somebody thinks he is very neat,

272
00:28:25.120 --> 00:28:28.960
he should hang himself by the nearest
tree. That’s what I sometimes feel.

273
00:28:28.960 --> 00:28:34.320
Because on this point
there are so many quarrels going on.

274
00:28:34.320 --> 00:28:36.160
But somebody who thinks he has a right

275
00:28:36.160 --> 00:28:39.360
to be untidy also should hang himself
by the nearest tree.

276
00:28:39.360 --> 00:28:43.200
And should know that, “I’m making
an inconvenience of myself to others.”

277
00:28:43.200 --> 00:28:46.880
You must respect.
If there is no mutual respect,

278
00:28:46.880 --> 00:28:53.040
this brother
and sister relationship is not there.

279
00:28:53.040 --> 00:28:56.640
It’s a very sweet relationship
which you have not enjoyed unfortunately.

280
00:28:57.760 --> 00:29:02.080
But in India we have.
Our brothers will give up their lives

281
00:29:02.080 --> 00:29:07.440
for us. And we will give our lives
for our brothers.

282
00:29:07.440 --> 00:29:10.400
And our brothers have so much faith in us

283
00:29:10.400 --> 00:29:13.840
that if we tell them that,
“You should not do this.”

284
00:29:13.840 --> 00:29:22.000
they know that this we are doing
only just to help him out,

285
00:29:22.000 --> 00:29:26.800
not to show off our great importance
or giving a big sermon,

286
00:29:26.800 --> 00:29:33.040
but it is just because we love him.
The love is so established

287
00:29:33.040 --> 00:29:39.680
and if that love is not established,
what are you showing off about?

288
00:29:39.680 --> 00:29:46.000
Today is, in a way, a very great year,
in the brothers and sisters relationship.

289
00:29:46.000 --> 00:29:49.920
How do you express your brothers
and sisters relationship?

290
00:29:49.920 --> 00:29:57.840
I do not like to hear complaints,
but I see that it is full of ego.

291
00:29:57.840 --> 00:30:03.440
The reason is,
people are behaving in such a manner

292
00:30:03.440 --> 00:30:06.560
that I cannot understand
that you are saints.

293
00:30:06.560 --> 00:30:12.880
What has happened to you?
How can you be individualistic?

294
00:30:12.880 --> 00:30:21.120
I’ll give you a simple example:
we have got in our house

295
00:30:21.120 --> 00:30:24.720
some sort of plants,
which could only grow inside the house,

296
00:30:24.720 --> 00:30:27.040
but when it was summertime,
we put them outside

297
00:30:27.040 --> 00:30:31.600
and they were growing well.
But when the winter came in suddenly

298
00:30:31.600 --> 00:30:38.240
one night they all became
absolutely dead you can call it.

299
00:30:38.240 --> 00:30:40.960
So, the servant got upset he said,
“What to do now?”

300
00:30:40.960 --> 00:30:43.760
I said, “You bring them inside.”
Now he said, “They won’t grow.”

301
00:30:43.760 --> 00:30:48.000
I said, “They will.”
I said, “You get four [or] five of them,

302
00:30:48.000 --> 00:30:57.360
put them together in one thing.”
And they started growing well.

303
00:30:57.360 --> 00:31:05.600
Because whatever is missing in one person,
you support from the another person.

304
00:31:05.600 --> 00:31:10.400
And this support is so natural
and spontaneous which flows.

305
00:31:10.400 --> 00:31:16.000
If you try to correct others
then you are draining out your energy

306
00:31:16.000 --> 00:31:22.459
and the energy of another person.
Just try to support that person.

307
00:31:22.459 --> 00:31:28.131
That’s how it works out. And that’s
how [CUT]

308
00:31:28.393 --> 00:31:32.160
have to make them into saplings,

309
00:31:32.160 --> 00:31:36.320
we never put them separately
we put them together, in a small block.

310
00:31:36.320 --> 00:31:40.480
If you put them separately
they will never come up.

311
00:31:40.480 --> 00:31:45.200
Then they are kept in that condition
together, till they grow.

312
00:31:45.200 --> 00:31:47.920
When they are grown,
then only they are taken

313
00:31:47.920 --> 00:31:56.480
from that collective group
and put separately.

314
00:31:56.480 --> 00:32:01.040
Have you not seen this happening?
And this is what is collectivity.

315
00:32:01.040 --> 00:32:05.440
At the delicate point
when Sahaj Yoga is coming up,

316
00:32:05.440 --> 00:32:08.480
we have to be much more closer together.

317
00:32:09.280 --> 00:32:11.920
Later on when you are very powerful
it’s all right

318
00:32:11.920 --> 00:32:15.680
because you will have greater rapport.
But it’s such a vicious circle

319
00:32:15.680 --> 00:32:24.160
that at this time when you are weak
you are also falling off.

320
00:32:24.160 --> 00:32:31.520
And this collectivity is all-embracing.

321
00:32:31.520 --> 00:32:35.840
Of course these are due to your ego,
superego, whatever problems.

322
00:32:35.840 --> 00:32:43.360
But only together you are going to be.
But I have seen, when you are mesmerised,

323
00:32:43.360 --> 00:32:49.200
you fall in love with each other,
absolutely: when you are mesmerised.

324
00:32:49.200 --> 00:32:54.400
But when there is freedom,
you cannot enjoy your collectivity.

325
00:32:54.400 --> 00:32:59.520
In freedom people find it very difficult:
then somebody behaves like an ascetic,

326
00:32:59.520 --> 00:33:07.504
some behaves like a madcap, somebody
behaves like a hot-tempered fellow,

327
00:33:07.504 --> 00:33:10.400
another behaves like a city consul.
I don’t know.

328
00:33:10.400 --> 00:33:20.800
When it is freedom
you do not grow in a healthy way together.

329
00:33:20.800 --> 00:33:24.080
You must know there must be something
within you which is keeping

330
00:33:24.080 --> 00:33:28.480
you out from collectivity.
At this stage the best thing

331
00:33:28.480 --> 00:33:31.440
is to surrender
and beat yourself with shoes.

332
00:33:31.440 --> 00:33:35.120
Any such ideas
come into your head you just do that way.

333
00:33:35.120 --> 00:33:37.760
That’s the way it will work out.

334
00:33:37.760 --> 00:33:42.080
Today is the day you have to promise,
today, here.

335
00:33:42.080 --> 00:33:46.360
Where is Cooly?
I can’t see him. Is he there?

336
00:33:46.360 --> 00:33:48.144
He wasn’t allowed to come, Mother.

337
00:33:48.144 --> 00:33:49.840
Hmm? He’s not come

338
00:33:49.840 --> 00:33:51.920
I think you said he wasn’t
allowed to come, Mother.

339
00:33:51.920 --> 00:33:53.280
He’s not come?

340
00:33:53.280 --> 00:33:55.040
He wasn’t allowed to come, Mother.

341
00:33:55.040 --> 00:33:56.720
He was not allowed?

342
00:33:56.720 --> 00:34:04.463
I think you told him
that he wasn’t allowed.

343
00:34:04.463 --> 00:34:11.680
All right. I did say.
I’m sorry. I did, I had to.

344
00:34:11.680 --> 00:34:21.440
Certain things had to be done. I am sorry.

345
00:34:21.440 --> 00:34:28.880
But you must know you are people
who are chosen specially.

346
00:34:28.880 --> 00:34:31.836
What prophecies are made
for you if you read that ‘Milton’

347
00:34:31.836 --> 00:34:38.400
(by William Blake) you will know —
the English people. What prophecies.

348
00:34:38.400 --> 00:34:44.560
“The Men of God will be there
and they will have their own heroes

349
00:34:44.560 --> 00:34:48.560
and they will not follow these Romans
and Greeks and their horrible heroes.

350
00:34:48.560 --> 00:34:53.920
They’ll have their innocent heroes,
and all those things.”

351
00:34:53.920 --> 00:35:07.120
And here I find that there’s
a kind of a passion for falling down.

352
00:35:07.120 --> 00:35:12.320
Keep together. Keep together.
Love each other. Understand them.

353
00:35:12.320 --> 00:35:20.240
Love not of mesmerism, but of freedom.
In freedom you must love each other.

354
00:35:20.240 --> 00:35:23.040
I never take away your freedom,
that’s one thing,

355
00:35:23.040 --> 00:35:26.880
whether you fall or rise.
First thing is for your freedom.

356
00:35:26.880 --> 00:35:31.440
That is the thing
on which you are going to move.

357
00:35:31.440 --> 00:35:35.600
So today is the day
where you all have to promise

358
00:35:35.600 --> 00:35:45.760
and pray that, this brotherhood
and sisterhood will be established.

359
00:35:45.760 --> 00:35:55.600
Ask for it in this soil of England,
this is the Jerusalem. Ask for that,

360
00:35:55.600 --> 00:36:00.400
that this will be established
on the soil of Jerusalem.

361
00:36:00.400 --> 00:36:07.880
That’s the most important thing.
And you will be surprised

362
00:36:07.880 --> 00:36:19.440
that once this is established,
Lakshmi is established.

363
00:36:19.440 --> 00:36:23.440
Now Mahalakshmi has eight aspects.

364
00:36:23.440 --> 00:36:33.520
Now read about these eight aspects.
How many there are, let us see.

365
00:36:33.520 --> 00:36:38.110
First follow.

366
00:36:38.110 --> 00:36:42.755
Om Twameva Sakshat
Shri Adya Lakshmi Namoh Namah.

367
00:36:42.755 --> 00:36:45.591
Adya Lakshmi.
Adya Lakshmi means Mahalakshmi.

368
00:36:45.591 --> 00:36:53.040
Adya Lakshmi. Adi, Adya.
Adya Lakshmi: that’s the first one.

369
00:36:53.040 --> 00:36:54.640
You say now, you repeat it.

370
00:36:54.640 --> 00:36:59.374
Om twameva Sakshat, Shri

371
00:36:59.374 --> 00:37:05.852
Adya Lakshmi
Sakshat, Shri Adi Shakti Sakshat,

372
00:37:05.852 --> 00:37:17.012
Shri Bhagawati Sakshat, Shri Mataji,
Shri Nirmala Devi, Namoh Namaha.

373
00:37:17.012 --> 00:37:26.920
Now, second one. Om Twameva Sakshat Shri Vidya
Lakshmi Namoh Namah.

374
00:37:26.920 --> 00:37:31.680
Vidya – vidya is the art of Sahaj Yoga,

375
00:37:31.680 --> 00:37:34.960
which you know. That is vidya.
The rest is all avidya.

376
00:37:34.960 --> 00:37:40.480
How to raise the Kundalini;
how to awaken all the deities;

377
00:37:40.480 --> 00:37:44.000
how to cleanse yourself;
how to cleanse others.

378
00:37:44.000 --> 00:37:47.200
All the knowledge;
all the science about that is called

379
00:37:47.200 --> 00:37:54.480
as vidya: the Lakshmi of that.
Lakshmi is the grace, is the grace.

380
00:37:54.480 --> 00:38:01.840
The awareness that is gracious.
The awareness that is gracious.

381
00:38:01.840 --> 00:38:08.720
So that Lakshmi should be with you,
not only to know the vidya,

382
00:38:08.720 --> 00:38:10.960
you know that, but to have grace about it.

383
00:38:10.960 --> 00:38:18.240
The way people do things, for example:
some people will just go on.

384
00:38:18.240 --> 00:38:23.259
All that kind of a nonsense you do.
Sometimes the way we go on working

385
00:38:23.259 --> 00:38:27.360
[on themselves], and I’m giving a lecture
and people are just working out.

386
00:38:27.360 --> 00:38:32.080
All that is most disgraceful
and disgracious (ungracious).

387
00:38:32.080 --> 00:38:41.600
So not to do these method of making
the thing look so disgracious.

388
00:38:41.600 --> 00:38:44.960
I mean you need not be serious
people at all,

389
00:38:44.960 --> 00:38:50.560
because Sahaj Yoga is not a serious thing.
It is a play.

390
00:38:50.560 --> 00:38:54.080
It is a play of grace.
You have to be gracious;

391
00:38:54.080 --> 00:38:57.840
you are not to be disgraceful,
that’s very important.

392
00:38:57.840 --> 00:39:03.680
If you are disgraceful
then your vidya is useless.

393
00:39:03.680 --> 00:39:06.880
I have seen many people all the time doing
like this, doing like that;

394
00:39:06.880 --> 00:39:10.320
they think that it’s their left hand job,

395
00:39:11.280 --> 00:39:13.760
you see, and they have become
now masters of this job.

396
00:39:13.760 --> 00:39:18.280
There’s no grace about it.
One has to see how to do it graciously.

397
00:39:18.280 --> 00:39:22.960
Do you see your Mother,
how She moves Her hands and feet.

398
00:39:22.960 --> 00:39:29.840
Not one day, one time,
even in one action you will find me doing

399
00:39:29.840 --> 00:39:40.960
something ungraceful like that except
when I copy you. (laughter)

400
00:39:40.960 --> 00:39:44.720
So this is what it is,
is the Vidya Lakshmi.

401
00:39:44.720 --> 00:39:49.186
Lakshmi is the grace to do everything.

402
00:39:49.186 --> 00:39:50.803
Come, second one, third.

403
00:39:50.803 --> 00:39:53.006
Om twameva Sakshat, Shri-

404
00:39:53.006 --> 00:39:55.221
… and now you could say it. “Om twameva…”

405
00:39:55.221 --> 00:40:11.918
Om twameva sakshat, Shri Vidya Lakshmi
sakshat, Shri Adi Shakti Sakshat,

406
00:40:11.918 --> 00:40:16.720
Shri Bhagawati Sakshat, Shri Mataji,
Shri Nirmala Devi, Namoh Namaha.

407
00:40:16.720 --> 00:40:23.901
For Left Swadishthana
you know this is the Mantra.

408
00:40:23.901 --> 00:40:25.234
Third One.

409
00:40:25.234 --> 00:40:31.055
Om twameva sakshat
Shri Saubhagnya Lakshmi namoh namaha.

410
00:40:32.394 --> 00:40:38.440
Sau-bha-gya,
Saubhagnya means ‘good fortune’.

411
00:40:38.440 --> 00:40:45.520
The Lakshmi
that gives you good fortune in every way.

412
00:40:45.520 --> 00:40:52.640
Like She gives you good fortune in money,
in your living,

413
00:40:52.640 --> 00:40:59.040
in your food, in every way.
Any good fortune is given through God.

414
00:40:59.040 --> 00:41:05.920
It’s only God who gives good fortune.
If you get money say in the racecourse,

415
00:41:05.920 --> 00:41:10.160
that’s bad fortune
because that will be lost next day

416
00:41:10.160 --> 00:41:17.440
or you will go to the pub to be free.
But if you get the real one,

417
00:41:17.440 --> 00:41:25.100
then you create something
out of it which is blissful and great:

418
00:41:25.100 --> 00:41:30.326
is Saubhagnya Lakshmi.
Now, say it. Saubhagnya Lakshmi.

419
00:41:30.589 --> 00:41:41.952
Om twameva sakshat, Shri Saubaghya
Lakshmi Sakshat, Shri Adi Shakti Sakshat,

420
00:41:41.952 --> 00:41:54.781
Shri Bhagawati Sakshat, Shri Mataji,
Shri Nirmala Devi, Namoh Namaha.

421
00:41:54.781 --> 00:42:01.484
Om Twameva Sakshat
Shri Amrut Lakshmi Namah.

422
00:42:01.484 --> 00:42:02.732
Amruta

423
00:42:02.732 --> 00:42:05.732
Amruta.
Amruta means the thing that does not die.

424
00:42:09.240 --> 00:42:18.280
In this world the Lakshmi exists
as your wealth.

425
00:42:18.280 --> 00:42:29.560
Now the wealth that does not die,
which is that wealth? Is the Spirit.

426
00:42:29.560 --> 00:42:35.640
So the grace of the Spirit
is the Amruta Lakshmi.

427
00:42:35.640 --> 00:42:41.480
Grace of the Spirit is the Amruta Lakshmi.
The rest of the things all will die out.

428
00:42:41.480 --> 00:42:47.000
And whatever is done through the Spirit,
to please the Spirit,

429
00:42:47.000 --> 00:42:59.480
is the Amruta Lakshmi,
for example: loving others.

430
00:42:59.480 --> 00:43:04.280
Loving others has a different
meaning in the symbolic way

431
00:43:04.280 --> 00:43:09.080
as you people understand it.
Loving means giving;

432
00:43:09.080 --> 00:43:20.680
doing without any expectation.
Just doing and enjoying it.

433
00:43:20.680 --> 00:43:27.800
The greatest is giving vibrations.
That is Amruta.

434
00:43:27.800 --> 00:43:39.429
Vibrations do not die.
That’s the Lakshmi of the Amruta.

435
00:43:40.429 --> 00:43:50.821
Om Twameva sakshat, Shri Amruta Lakshmi
Sakshat, Shri Adi Shakti Sakshat,

436
00:43:51.501 --> 00:44:01.519
Shri Bhagawati Sakshat, Shri Mataji,
Shri Nirmala Devi, Namoh Namaha.

437
00:44:05.584 --> 00:44:10.062
Om Twameva Sakshat Shri Kaam Lakshmi…

438
00:44:10.062 --> 00:44:13.608
No, Gruhalakshmi.
You know that, Gruhalakshmi.

439
00:44:13.675 --> 00:44:25.895
Om twameva Sakshat, Shri Gruhalakshmi
Sakshat, Shri Adi Shakti Sakshat,

440
00:44:25.895 --> 00:44:37.229
Shri Bhagawati Sakshat, Shri Mataji,
Shri Nirmala Devi, Namoh Namaha”.

441
00:44:37.229 --> 00:44:38.858
Ha.

442
00:44:38.858 --> 00:44:44.768
Om Twameva Sakshat
Shri Satya Lakshmi Namah.

443
00:44:44.768 --> 00:44:48.040
Sa-tya: [as] I told awareness.

444
00:44:48.040 --> 00:44:52.280
She is the one who has given
you awareness.

445
00:44:52.280 --> 00:45:00.396
Awareness is Lakshmi’s character.
Satya means the truth.

446
00:45:01.000 --> 00:45:06.680
As you rise in your awareness,
you know the truth.

447
00:45:06.680 --> 00:45:17.160
Now what is the truth?
What is the truth? What are we aware of?

448
00:45:19.480 --> 00:45:30.040
You are aware that you are the instrument
of God and that He is working through you.

449
00:45:30.040 --> 00:45:37.320
You are aware of that because it’s flowing
on your central nervous system.

450
00:45:37.320 --> 00:45:46.120
This is the truth
of which you have to be aware.

451
00:45:46.120 --> 00:45:57.880
What is the other truth?
Is who are you? That you are the Spirit.

452
00:45:57.880 --> 00:46:04.920
And the third truth is, who am I?

453
00:46:04.920 --> 00:46:10.200
And the fourth truth is who is God?

454
00:46:10.200 --> 00:46:13.960
What is your destiny?

455
00:46:13.960 --> 00:46:20.172
If they become your awareness,
then you have got Satya Lakshmi.

456
00:46:20.172 --> 00:46:21.573
Say now.

457
00:46:21.573 --> 00:46:35.147
Om Twameva Sakshat, Shri Satya Lakshmi
Sakshat, Shri Adi Shakti Sakshat,

458
00:46:35.147 --> 00:46:45.422
Shri Bhagawati Sakshat, Shri Mataji,
Shri Nirmala Devi, Namoh Namaha.

459
00:46:48.736 --> 00:46:54.979
Om Twameva Sakshat
Shri Bhogya Lakshmi Namah.

460
00:46:54.979 --> 00:46:57.925
Mm?
Bhogya Lakshmi.

461
00:46:57.925 --> 00:47:04.520
Bhogya Lakshmi. Bho-gya:
‘Bhoga’ means the one by which you enjoy,

462
00:47:04.520 --> 00:47:10.920
by which you enjoy.
I mean it’s like the whole ocean of joy

463
00:47:10.920 --> 00:47:17.480
is around you and you are like a bird
who cannot drink it.

464
00:47:17.480 --> 00:47:27.560
Only through the grace of Bhogya Lakshmi,
you can enjoy that.

465
00:47:27.560 --> 00:47:30.520
So, the Spirit, though it is manifesting,

466
00:47:30.520 --> 00:47:35.560
you are not enjoying
your Spirit – even that.

467
00:47:35.560 --> 00:47:40.600
Anything that you see —
say you see a flower —

468
00:47:40.600 --> 00:47:47.320
you should be able to enjoy.
You cannot enjoy because there is thought.

469
00:47:47.320 --> 00:47:55.480
Anything you do [if] there is thought,
you cannot enjoy.

470
00:47:55.480 --> 00:48:02.680
When the Spirit is flowing
you get complete enjoyment.

471
00:48:02.680 --> 00:48:07.975
Actually I should say,
I am the enjoyer of it.

472
00:48:14.748 --> 00:48:26.355
Om twameva Sakshat, Shri Bhogya Lakshmi
Sakshat, Shri Adi Shakti Sakshat,

473
00:48:26.355 --> 00:48:38.479
Shri Bhagawati Sakshat, Shri Mataji,
Shri Nirmala Devi, Namoh Namaha.

474
00:48:42.723 --> 00:48:47.630
Om Twameva Sakshat
Shri Yoga Lakshmi Namah.

475
00:48:47.630 --> 00:48:51.640
Yoga Lakshmi.

476
00:48:51.640 --> 00:49:00.040
The Lakshmi’s power which gives you Yoga.

477
00:49:00.040 --> 00:49:11.313
Lakshmi supports your power
of yoga by giving you awareness.

478
00:49:12.040 --> 00:49:21.480
The power by which you take to yoga
is all combined as Yoga Lakshmi.

479
00:49:21.480 --> 00:49:28.680
Like your affluence: you are not satisfied
and you want to have Yoga.

480
00:49:28.680 --> 00:49:34.120
The dissatisfaction you get
till you have got yoga is coming

481
00:49:34.120 --> 00:49:46.680
from the Yoga Lakshmi.
So Yoga Lakshmi is the power which gives

482
00:49:46.680 --> 00:49:53.320
you or takes you to your grace,
by which you go to yoga:

483
00:49:53.320 --> 00:49:56.840
that’s Yoga Lakshmi.
Means the kind of a satisfaction

484
00:49:56.840 --> 00:50:09.040
that you seek is manifested
in you through this power of Yoga Lakshmi.

485
00:50:10.600 --> 00:50:14.520
And then once you have achieved your yoga,
you get the grace.

486
00:50:14.520 --> 00:50:23.720
Lakshmi is the grace.
So you get the grace of a saint.

487
00:50:23.720 --> 00:50:28.680
You should have the grace of a saint.
You should look like a saint.

488
00:50:28.680 --> 00:50:37.550
You are a saint.
I think better write it on your mirrors,

489
00:50:37.550 --> 00:50:42.120
“We are saints. We are men of God.

490
00:50:42.120 --> 00:50:49.400
We have to behave like saints.
We are saints.” You are, no doubt.

491
00:50:49.400 --> 00:50:56.040
You are men of God, no doubt,
but you have to turn your faces this way.

492
00:50:56.040 --> 00:51:01.880
So, this is the Yoga Lakshmi.
For example a person

493
00:51:01.880 --> 00:51:05.000
who has got Yoga Lakshmi
doesn’t quarrel like a madcap.

494
00:51:07.800 --> 00:51:15.800
If he quarrels or dominates someone
in a foolish way then he’s still lacking

495
00:51:15.800 --> 00:51:21.076
that Lakshmi point.
There’s a grace about it,

496
00:51:21.076 --> 00:51:27.760
the whole way of talking.
How you talk to a saint? All

497
00:51:37.640 --> 00:51:53.320
right.

498
00:51:53.320 --> 00:51:57.440
Om twameva Sakshat, Shri Yoga Lakshmi
Sakshat, Shri Adi Shakti Sakshat,

499
00:51:57.440 --> 00:52:00.920
Shri Bhagawati Sakshat, Shri Mataji,
Shri Nirmala Devi Namoh Namaha.

500
00:52:00.920 --> 00:52:15.480
So these are the eight-fold paths
by which one has to grace oneself.

501
00:52:15.480 --> 00:52:27.307
This is the attire of Sahaj Yogis.
And today you have asked for it.

502
00:52:27.307 --> 00:52:44.600
May God give you that power.

503
00:52:57.400 --> 00:53:00.040
One more thing I have to say just before

504
00:53:00.040 --> 00:53:07.240
we start doing the thing [is] that around
the Lakshmi you know is the Void.

505
00:53:07.240 --> 00:53:17.880
And though the Lakshmi in a situation
where there is negativity,

506
00:53:18.680 --> 00:53:23.720
She runs away, She is frightened.
She is a frightened Deity.

507
00:53:23.720 --> 00:53:29.160
She is very sensitive.
She doesn’t like any negativity.

508
00:53:29.160 --> 00:53:34.040
As soon
as the negativity comes in She runs away.

509
00:53:34.040 --> 00:53:40.520
In the same way those people, those great
saints who were born on the Void,

510
00:53:40.520 --> 00:53:49.800
have said that, “Those people
who try to frighten Lakshmi are the people

511
00:53:49.800 --> 00:53:55.000
who are irreligious,”
in the sense they drink.

512
00:53:55.000 --> 00:54:03.560
Those people who drink, in the third
generation lose their Lakshmi completely.

513
00:54:03.560 --> 00:54:07.464
You can see the results now:
those who used to take one peg (30

514
00:54:07.464 --> 00:54:12.520
ml of alcohol), now are sitting
in the pub the whole night.

515
00:54:12.520 --> 00:54:17.320
And that’s what it is that,
once these things enter into your family

516
00:54:17.320 --> 00:54:21.720
or household,
they start corroding your Lakshmi.

517
00:54:21.720 --> 00:54:26.760
That’s why we have to understand
that Lakshmi is very,

518
00:54:26.760 --> 00:54:31.560
very sensitive to this point.
And Lakshmi is extremely

519
00:54:31.560 --> 00:54:39.720
sensitive to fanaticism,
extremely sensitive to fanaticism.

520
00:54:39.720 --> 00:54:44.600
Any kind of fanatic ideas you have got,
She will run away.

521
00:54:44.600 --> 00:54:49.000
She can’t stand fanaticism.
As soon as fanaticism will settle

522
00:54:49.000 --> 00:54:55.720
down into any country,
it will start becoming poorer and poorer.

523
00:54:55.720 --> 00:55:02.520
Any kind of fanaticism
about religion is to be avoided.

524
00:55:02.520 --> 00:55:08.600
Now so many young people who are aware
of fanaticism because, thank God,

525
00:55:08.600 --> 00:55:14.600
there are some horrible fanatics
which have proved that fanaticism is bad,

526
00:55:14.600 --> 00:55:20.760
and they are now coming round it.
But when fanaticism works out,

527
00:55:20.760 --> 00:55:30.440
the expulsion of all the powers
of Lakshmi from within, that’s the sure

528
00:55:30.440 --> 00:55:37.400
and certain sign that you really
invite cancer, really invite cancer.

529
00:55:37.400 --> 00:55:41.400
Also alcohol does,
but this is the triggering point.

530
00:55:41.400 --> 00:55:48.760
If an alcoholic is also a fanatic,
it will trigger much faster.

531
00:55:48.760 --> 00:55:53.880
Fanaticism is to be to be avoided
like leprosy for Sahaja Yogis.

532
00:55:53.880 --> 00:55:57.240
But not only that,
we have to stand up in a revolt

533
00:55:57.240 --> 00:55:59.560
against all kinds of fanaticism.

534
00:55:59.560 --> 00:56:08.520
Just this is the revolution
against all fanaticism of life.

535
00:56:08.520 --> 00:56:13.640
That’s very important
for the establishment of Shri Lakshmi.

536
00:56:13.640 --> 00:56:20.280
Any religion, any fanaticism
that collides with another religion

537
00:56:20.280 --> 00:56:23.160
or in any way belittles it —
because all religions

538
00:56:23.160 --> 00:56:27.240
are just the same of one God —
belittles another religion

539
00:56:27.240 --> 00:56:36.440
or insults anyone is absolutely
against Lakshmi’s Principle.

540
00:56:36.440 --> 00:56:40.440
So we go, after all this,
when we rise above this,

541
00:56:40.440 --> 00:56:43.800
we go to Mahalakshmi principle.
Now the awareness

542
00:56:43.800 --> 00:56:48.520
that was seeking up to Lakshmi —
means you achieve money,

543
00:56:48.520 --> 00:56:53.640
achieve position for achieving grace,
once you have achieved the grace of this,

544
00:56:53.640 --> 00:56:59.080
you want to achieve God.
And this new awakening within

545
00:56:59.080 --> 00:57:04.600
you that you have to achieve
God now is the power of Mahalakshmi.

546
00:57:04.600 --> 00:57:07.720
By the power of Mahalakshmi only,

547
00:57:07.720 --> 00:57:11.720
you achieve your saintliness,
your Realisation.

548
00:57:11.720 --> 00:57:16.440
That’s why She came on this earth
as the Mother of Jesus Christ.

549
00:57:16.440 --> 00:57:20.040
That was Mahalakshmi,
not Lakshmi but Mahalakshmi.

550
00:57:22.114 --> 00:57:24.754
May God bless you.
